{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1443519-2e-optimal-combinations-knacks-purviews-psp","id":1443519,"title":"2e Optimal Combinations? Knacks + Purviews + PSP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-11T15:23:40-07:00","id":1443519,"title":"2e Optimal Combinations? Knacks + Purviews + PSP","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I am just familiarising with second edition, and I just noticed that some combinations of Callings and Purviews offer really focused characters that surpass equivalent choices and are thematically appropriate:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Adversary/Outsider/Trickster + Deception</b><b>/Epic Charisma</b><b> + Metamorphosis</b><br /> Illusionist Shapechanger.\u200b</li> <li><b>Creator/Druid/</b>\u200b<b>Sage + Forge + Demiurgy</b><br /> Technomancer Crafter.</li> <li><b>Druid/Judge/Sage + Chaos/Fortune/Magic + Geasa OR</b><b> Tzolk\u02bcin </b><b>OR Wyrd</b><br /> Hexxer Prophet.</li> <li><b>Druid/Sage/Trickster + Fortune/Magic + Arcane Calculus</b><br /> Dark Magus</li> <li><b>Guardian/Healer/Sheppard + Fertility/Health + Paganito</b><br /> Stalwart Defender</li> <li><b>Guardian/Hunter/Warrior + Epic Dexterity/</b>\u200b<b>Epic Perception/Epic Stamina/</b>\u200b<b>Epic Strength</b><b> + Yidam</b><br /> Invincible Fighter\u200b</li> <li><b>Hunter/Liminal/Psychopomp\u200b</b>\u200b<b> + Journeys + Nemeton</b><br /> Portable Base.\u200b</li> <li><b>Judge/Hunter/Warrior + Death/Order + Nextlahualli</b><br /> Eternal Executioner.</li> <li><b>Judge/Leader + Epic Charisma</b>\u200b/<b>Order + Shuil\u00e1</b><br /> Supreme Leader and Judge.</li> <li><b>Judge/</b><b>Leader + Order + Tianming</b><br /> Master of the Red Tape.\u200b</li> <li><b>Judge/Leader</b><b>/Trickster + Chaos/Order + Asha</b><br /> Ultimate Balance.</li> <li><b>Judge/</b>\u200b<b>Leader/Warrior + Epic Charisma</b>\u200b<b>/</b>\u200b\u200b<b>War + Mana</b><br /> Lord of War.\u200b</li> <li><b>Leader/Psychopomp + Death + Cheval OR Qut</b><br /> Spiritual Potentate</li> <li><b>Leader/</b>\u200b<b>Lover/Trickster</b>\u200b<b> + Beauty/Epic Charisma/Passion + Dvoeverie</b>\u200b<br /> Social Manipulator\u200b.</li> </ol>Are there other combinations that are more potent or focused? My favourites are:<ul><li><b>Adversary/Outsider/</b>\u200b<b>Trickster + Deception/Epic Charisma</b>\u200b<b> + Metamorphosis</b>, probably the most powerful of the builds here.\u200b</li> <li><b>Creator/Druid/</b>\u200b<b>Sage </b>+ <b>Forge </b>+ <b>Demiurgy,</b> a force multiplier by crafting equipment and managing technology.</li> <li><b>Druid/Judge/Sage + Chaos/Fortune/Magic</b>\u200b<b> + Geasa OR Tzolk\u02bcin </b>\u200b<b>OR Wyrd, </b>I just love this concept, and it is very strong.</li> <li><b>Leader/</b>\u200b\u200b<b>Lover/Trickster</b>\u200b<b> + Beauty/Epic Charisma/</b>\u200b<b>Passion + Dvoeverie</b>\u200b, the team &quot;Face&quot;.</li> </ul>As stated, I am very new with the system so maybe I am writing things that others have already mentioned, or that are impossible, if so please explain to me the reasoning.<br /> <br /> Thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 03-07-2026, 10:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T16:42:05-07:00","id":1443533,"title":"","content":"In Scion, much like in Exalted, you are encouraged to maximize things. After all, the end of your character is you reaching god status. By the same token, you can flavor that as being the best judge or else the best trickster or else a judge who tricks people into revealing their guilt. So, you can go as optimized as possible in something or else you can flavor things to being how you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T06:15:58-07:00","id":1443585,"title":"","content":"While any combination in your own flavour can work great, I would add:<br /> Judge/Hunter + Death/Order + Nextlahualli - Eternal Executioner<br /> Mainly because Teotl is particularly optimal for regular human sacrifice, which gains legend, momentum, triggers the 'don't need to eat or breathe' boon and generates extra momentum if the rest of the party have 'narrative difficulty' with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26642-notmidas","name":"notMidas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T06:18:23-07:00","id":1443586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>notMidas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1443519-2e-optimal-combinations-knacks-purviews-psp?p=1443585#post1443585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While any combination in your own flavour can work great, I would add:<br /> Judge/Hunter + Death/Order + Nextlahualli - Eternal Executioner<br /> Mainly because Teotl is particularly optimal for regular human sacrifice, which gains legend, momentum, triggers the 'don't need to eat or breathe' boon and generates extra momentum if the rest of the party have 'narrative difficulty' with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. Adding to the list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}